docs {
  # Storage locations

  Named places where a reader keeps physical copies (`Home`, `Office`, `Study Shelf`). Each
  reader has their own locations; names are unique per reader ignoring case and extra spaces.
  There is deliberately **no delete endpoint** yet.

  Run the folder in order. **Register locations reader** creates its own disposable account, so
  the folder is independent of Auth and Books. Contract: `docs/api-contract.md` ("Locations").
}
